{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Marisa  $Koishi  >Deep below the Asama Purifying Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a grueling battle, Marisa Kirisame",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the goddess of unchanging."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> However...”"
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >“A torrent of impurity from the Outside World will also rush in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> What happens after that... is in your hands.”"
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >“Why don’t you witness for yourself how Gensokyo changes?”"
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >“That Incident Stone was certainly the real deal."
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Within the forest of the sanctuary."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Not only is it called a sanctuary, the forest also hides a pyramid within it."
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Nothing out of the ordinary here... hey, you there!”"
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Koishi  >“Huh?”"
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“What’s someone from the underground like you doing here?”"
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Koishi  >“Oh? Huh? You can see me? For real?”"
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Koishi  >“Normally no one should be able to."
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> And I was having so much fun too."
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> But if I’m being watched, it’s, like, so embarrassing~”"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“I don't really get it, but what are you up to around here?”"
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Koishi  >“I was just passing through.",
                "<l$> The barrier that was up here has vanished recently.”"
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Oh yeah, that barrier vanished when the incident was resolved."
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> I’m just doing a follow-up investigation."
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Well, if you’re just passing through, I guess that’s fine.”"
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Koishi  >“What’s this? Why is big sister there?”"
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Huh? There’s no one here.”"
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Koishi  >“Liar, I can sense her presence coming from your pocket.”"
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Wh-wh-what do you mean!?"
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Oh, could it be...”"
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Perhaps Koishi’s ability to blend into her surroundings had been weakened",
                "by the effects of the power of changelessness."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Ending No.13 — Pocket Satori$>"
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just as Koishi said, the eerie aura emanated from the Incident Stone",
                "was Satori's aura itself."
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Moreover, why the usually invisible Koishi was perceivable today?"
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The presence of her big sister, Satori Komeiji, was in fact",
                "coming from the Incident Stone."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Thanks to you, I can take some time off work. I'm grateful.”"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Wait, return Gensokyo to normal first!”"
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >“You needn’t worry. Once I withdraw my power, Gensokyo should return to normal."
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“What? ‘In my hands’...? What do you mean?”"
            ]
        }
    }
}